.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Node (frontend)
node_modules/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Pre-audit backups (debug artifacts from one-off data repairs)
# Broadened to catch suffixed variants like *.bak.eb-verify-<date> (G8).
*.bak
*.bak.*

# Hotel-audit inputs and outputs — PII, never committable.
# hotel_audit.py reads a registration-admin export (LastName, FirstName, City,
# State, ZipCode, PayerName) and writes a workbook keyed on the same people,
# ~1.9K of them for a major, including parents of minors. This repo is public
# and GitHub keeps orphaned blobs after a delete, so one `git add -A` before
# these rules existed would have been irreversible. The tool now defaults its
# output into hotel_audit_out/; the bare patterns cover the documented
# `-o worldopen_audit.xlsx` / `--payers export.csv` invocations at repo root.
hotel_audit_out/
*.xlsx
*.xls
export*.csv
*_audit.csv
